   "body": "### Streamed mcp_tool_use drops server_name\n\n**Medium Severity**\n\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\nStreamed `mcp_tool_use` accumulation copies `id`, `name`, and `input` from `content_block_start` but not required `server_name`. Span output then omits that field, so traces and raw-response replay lose which MCP server was invoked, unlike the non-streaming `model_as_dict` path.\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\n\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 4c9f6506-3a9f-4c0c-a246-b59bce0cf359 -->\n\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\nsrc/lmnr/opentelemetry_lib/opentelemetry/instrumentation/anthropic/streaming.py#L86-L90\nsrc/lmnr/opentelemetry_lib/opentelemetry/instrumentation/anthropic/span_utils.py#L270-L277\nsrc/lmnr/opentelemetry_lib/opentelemetry/instrumentation/anthropic/event_models.py#L13-L20\nLOCATIONS END -->\n<details>\n<summary>Additional Locations (2)</summary>\n\n- [`src/lmnr/opentelemetry_lib/opentelemetry/instrumentation/anthropic/span_utils.py#L270-L277`](https://github.com/lmnr-ai/lmnr-python/blob/44f7eb278ee87c3652d5ad907168d2ebb8c9afb3/src/lmnr/opentelemetry_lib/opentelemetry/instrumentation/anthropic/span_utils.py#L270-L277)\n- [`src/lmnr/opentelemetry_lib/opentelemetry/instrumentation/anthropic/event_models.py#L13-L20`](https://github.com/lmnr-ai/lmnr-python/blob/44f7eb278ee87c3652d5ad907168d2ebb8c9afb3/src/lmnr/opentelemetry_lib/opentelemetry/instrumentation/anthropic/event_models.py#L13-L20)\n\n</details>\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/open?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(pr